{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you survive the Card Gauntlet?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Gauntlet is a rougelike deckbuilding game that combines a linear dice board with RPG class skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose a Class and Specialization</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/specialization.gif?t=1743001159\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Within the Mage and Knight Class, you'll find 6 totally unique <strong>Specializations</strong> to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each <strong>Specialization</strong> has a their own unique set of <strong>Skill Cards </strong>they can collect in a run. Level up your <strong>Specialization</strong> to unlock even more <strong>Skills Cards </strong>and help you beat the Gauntlet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect and Build a Unique Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/cards.gif?t=1743001159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are over 115\u00a0<strong>Skill Cards</strong> and <strong>Item Cards</strong> to collect, with hundreds of Deck combinations to choose from. Pick your favorite <strong>Class</strong> and <strong>Specialization</strong> to run with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight Your Way Through a Gauntlet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587960/extras/fight.gif?t=1743001159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your <strong>Skill Cards</strong>\u00a0to take on challenging Creatures across 5 Biomes. Unlock even more powerful  <strong>Talent Cards</strong>\u00a0that can turn the tide of battle for you. Randomly generated Gauntlets have different Creatures and Bosses to fight, so no two runs are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstat